1
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:11,136
Ted! Ted! Ted!

2
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:12,262
What is going on?

3
00:00:12,262 --> 00:00:14,097
Am I dreaming
or am I looking at

4
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:15,765
head coach
Ted Vincent?

5
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:16,725
Going out there,

6
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:18,309
warming up
mid-halftime.

7
00:00:18,685 --> 00:00:20,186
It must be raining
cats and dogs,

8
00:00:20,186 --> 00:00:21,438
cuz I feel
like barking.

9
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:23,440
Ted,

10
00:00:23,898 --> 00:00:25,525
you're that
leg-broken loser.

11
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:26,901
Don't tell me
you're actually

12
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,486
thinking of
getting in the game.

13
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:29,487
You got that right.

14
00:00:31,364 --> 00:00:32,365
You're in
your thirties, man.

15
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:33,366
What good
is that gonna do?

16
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:34,743
My team's
valued at over

17
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:35,785
a billion dollars.

18
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:37,912
You're just a
worthless cripple.

19
00:00:38,329 --> 00:00:39,372
A billion dollars, huh?

20
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:40,373
Big deal.

21
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:43,126
I can single-
handedly steamroll

22
00:00:43,126 --> 00:00:44,294
your entire team.

23
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:45,837
Your boss
is out of her mind.

24
00:00:46,212 --> 00:00:46,963
And she thinks
you're gonna score

25
00:00:46,963 --> 00:00:47,672
a single point.

26
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:49,132
What if I score?

27
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:50,633
What if you score?

28
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:52,594
Let's make it a bet.

29
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:55,388
You score one point,
you can slap me

30
00:00:55,388 --> 00:00:56,473
in the face
one time.

31
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:58,183
But when you don't,

32
00:00:58,183 --> 00:00:59,601
I get to slap the
shit out of you.

33
00:00:59,851 --> 00:01:00,977
Better get you
some ice ready.

34
00:01:02,103 --> 00:01:03,438
Your face is
gonna need it later.

35
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:09,694
Game's almost lost

36
00:01:09,694 --> 00:01:10,987
and he's
still talking big.

37
00:01:11,404 --> 00:01:13,364
I'm gonna turn his
face into bacon later.

38
00:01:14,783 --> 00:01:15,408
Let's go.

39
00:01:18,078 --> 00:01:18,703
You ready?

40
00:01:28,588 --> 00:01:29,798
Let's do this.

41
00:01:34,636 --> 00:01:36,012
Yeah, Ted!

42
00:01:36,012 --> 00:01:37,639
-Whoa!
-Yeah!

43
00:01:37,847 --> 00:01:39,891
-Whoa!
-Let's go, Ted!

44
00:01:57,158 --> 00:01:58,326
He threw
that way too far.

45
00:01:58,326 --> 00:01:59,244
No one's
catching that.

46
00:01:59,369 --> 00:02:00,328
He don't even
know how to play.

47
00:02:00,912 --> 00:02:02,455
He's scared stiff.

48
00:02:02,956 --> 00:02:04,332
You scared him
so bad

49
00:02:04,332 --> 00:02:05,667
he forgot
how to play.

50
00:02:05,792 --> 00:02:06,459
Yeah, I got him.

51
00:02:06,459 --> 00:02:07,210
I got him.

52
00:02:15,093 --> 00:02:15,760
Yes!

53
00:02:22,308 --> 00:02:23,434
Holy guacamole,

54
00:02:23,601 --> 00:02:25,311
the Knights'
quarterback is

55
00:02:25,311 --> 00:02:27,313
scrambling out
into the open field?

56
00:02:27,647 --> 00:02:28,731
I must have eaten
something weird

57
00:02:28,731 --> 00:02:30,525
for breakfast today
because I feel like

58
00:02:30,525 --> 00:02:32,026
I am tripping,
ladies and gentlemen.

59
00:02:32,402 --> 00:02:33,653
A scrambling
quarterback?

60
00:02:33,653 --> 00:02:34,529
Has he
lost his mind?

61
00:02:34,821 --> 00:02:36,114
Boss, thank God
I fired this guy,

62
00:02:36,114 --> 00:02:36,906
cuz he would
have wrecked

63
00:02:36,906 --> 00:02:37,657
our entire team.

64
00:02:42,996 --> 00:02:43,663
Here!

65
00:02:56,593 --> 00:02:58,219
What a wild play.

66
00:02:58,553 --> 00:03:00,346
Nobody even came
close to catching

67
00:03:00,346 --> 00:03:02,140
Ted Vincent, and
he makes a score.
